<title>USA: TABLE-ASTRA Q2 PS0.034/SHR VS PS 0.026/SH.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ASTRA Q2 PS0.034/SHR VS PS 0.026/SH.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>		     1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.034		   $0.026</p>
<p> Net		 16.0		     11.0</p>
<p> Revs		91.0		     73.0</p>
<p>NOTE: All data above in millions of Argentina pesos, except per share numbers.</p>
<p>Results are for the second quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is Astra Cia Argentina de Petroleo SA.</p>
<p>Earnings per share were calculated on 47 million outstanding shares with a nominal value of 10 pesos per share for the second quarter of fiscal 1997, and 42 million shares with a nominal value of 10 pesos per share for the second quarter of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The company is an Argentine producer of gas and oil.</p>
